error[E0227]: malformed interpolated string
 --> $DIR/interpolation-conditional.nra:3:18
  |
3 | let text = $"{ok ? 1 : 2}";
  |                  ^ a conditional at the top of a hole is written in parentheses
  |
  = note: the first ':' outside brackets begins the hole's specification
help: parenthesize the conditional
  |
3 | let text = $"{(ok ? 1 : 2)}";
  |               ~~~~~~~~~~~~

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0227`.
